        "text": "4. STRUCT-LIKE VALUES AND KICKOFF - begin_play buys a potion through the data table, then builds a Vec3\n(a struct of x, y, z) with `Vec3 New` and reads a field back with `Vec3 X`. Vec2, Vec4, Quat and\nTransform work the same way (see the Types categories in the palette).",
